1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:08,829
At two seconds, the oxygen supply is cut to zero, and energy begins to drain from every neuron.

2
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:15,544
Seconds later, potassium floods out of the cells, and a wave of depolarisation sweeps across the brain.

3
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,728
After a brief burst of firing, the network falls silent.

